#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "VIOLET"
msgstr "VIOLETT"

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "Your team has eaten too many mushrooms.\nYou hear a sound in the distance. Follow it …"
msgstr "Euer Team hat zu viele Pilze gegessen.\nIhr hört aus der Ferne einen Klang. Folgt ihm …"

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "Follow the bass and the glowing mushrooms to Oberer Schorchen."
msgstr "Folgt dem Bass und den leuchtenden Pilzen in den Oberen Schorchen."

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "Awaken the sound totems: TURQUOISE → PINK → VIOLET. [E]"
msgstr "Weckt die Klangtotems: TÜRKIS → PINK → VIOLETT. [E]"

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "The bartender wants three glowing mushrooms from around the floor. Pick them. [E]"
msgstr "Der Barkeeper will drei leuchtende Pilze von rund um die Tanzfläche. Pflück sie. [E]"

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "The DJ hands you a mushroom of his own. Eat it at the bar. [E]"
msgstr "Der DJ drückt dir einen eigenen Pilz in die Hand. Iss ihn an der Bar. [E]"

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "Run to the totem that flashes. Four rounds, ten seconds each."
msgstr "Lauf zum Totem, das aufblitzt. Vier Runden, je zehn Sekunden."

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "Heads spinning. Get the Clear Head drink at the bar. [E]"
msgstr "Der Kopf dreht sich. Hol dir den Klarkopf-Drink an der Bar. [E]"

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "Stay in the glowing dance circle for the finale."
msgstr "Bleibt für das Finale im leuchtenden Tanzkreis."

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "The bass woke the dead. Clear the dance floor!"
msgstr "Der Bass hat die Toten geweckt. Räum die Tanzfläche!"

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "The last beat fades away. Take this moment with you."
msgstr "Der letzte Beat klingt aus. Nehmt diesen Moment mit."

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "Final quest: collect the Echo of the Night in front of the DJ booth. [E]"
msgstr "Abschlussauftrag: Holt das Echo der Nacht vor dem DJ-Pult ab. [E]"

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "Bring the Echo of the Night back to the campfire. Gather your team and place it in the fire. [E]"
msgstr "Bringt das Echo der Nacht zurück zur Feuerstelle. Sammelt das Team und legt es ins Feuer. [E]"

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "The echo burns away. Stay together by the fire until your heads are clear."
msgstr "Das Echo verglüht. Bleibt zusammen am Feuer, bis der Kopf wieder klar ist."

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "[E] Tune sound totem · %s"
msgstr "[E] Klangtotem stimmen · %s"

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "Turquoise"
msgstr "Türkis"

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
msgid "Pink"
msgstr "Pink"

#: scripts/secret_night.gd
